# Pull request Mac verify

On a PR with **code changes**, run on the Mac (via `just`, which holds the machine-wide lock):

1. `just smoke`
2. `just verify-only` for every runnable check tied to the diff. Resolve checks with `scripts/verify-path-checks.sh` and [feature-map.json](.cursor/skills/verify-superreader/feature-map.json).

Do **not** run `just verify` (full suite) on a PR unless you are cutting a **release tag**.

A **rebase-only** PR with no file changes merges on green CI without another Mac verify pass.

Cloud agents must not acquire the verify lock or run Mac UI verify. Use `python3 scripts/verify --dry-run --smoke` or `--dry-run --only …` to validate selection on Linux.
